	gic: The Gathering The Hobbit Pre-Release at CCS Houston! Gather your pack
	s\, forge your deck\, and test your strategy against other adventurers in 
	this exciting sealed tournament. \n  \n🗓️ Date: August 7\, 2026\n📍 Location
	: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \n📝 Event Overview:\n
	\nFormat: Sealed\nTournament Structure: Swiss Rounds\nExpected Number of R
	ounds: 3\nPlayer Capacity: 24\nEntry Fee: $35\nSign Up: On-Site\n\n  \n💰 P
	rize Pool:\n\n1 The Hobbit pack per win\n\n  \n📋 Registration Details:\n\n
	Doors Open: 3:00 PM\nOn-Site Registration start: 6:00 PM\nRound 1 Begins: 
	7:00 PM\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/mtg-the-hobbit-pre-release/\n\nF
	rom CCS Houston
